            "question": "<strong>How do I choose my size?</strong>",
            "answer": "<ul><li>Start with the size guide on each product page. Look especially at the model: his height, weight and the size he is wearing are shown on every piece, so you can compare with your own build, which is the most reliable way to judge fit. </li><li>Each product page also lists the detailed cut and material. Fits vary across the collection, from relaxed to more structured, so check each piece. If you are between two sizes, compare the measurements with a garment you already own and like. </li><li>Still unsure? Write to us at <a href=\"mailto:contact@coldral.com\">contact@coldral.com</a> and we will help you choose.</li></ul>"
          }
