            "question": "<strong>Orders not received and returned items verification ?</strong>",
            "answer": "<p>At Cold Ral, we take every order seriously and treat each customer with respect. In rare cases, some individuals claim a package was not received or return items that do not match the original order. To protect all of our customers and maintain fair practices, we follow a strict and transparent process.</p><p><strong>What happens if I claim I did not receive my order</strong><br/><br/>If a parcel is marked as delivered but you report it missing, we open an investigation with the carrier. No refunds are issued during this process. Once the investigation is completed, we can offer either a store credit or a reshipment of the items. We do not provide refunds for parcels declared delivered by the carrier.</p><p><strong>What happens if I return an item</strong><br/><br/>We only issue refunds after receiving the returned parcel and verifying that all items are correct, complete, unused, unwashed, and with all original labels attached. This is necessary to protect our stock and ensure fairness for all customers. We are not a multinational company and we take the time required to complete our verification process properly.</p><p>Thank you for your understanding.</p>"
